---
/**
 * The homepage's signature section-opening ornament: two gradient hairlines
 * meeting a slowly-rotating eight-point star flanked by two gold diamonds.
 * DESIGN.md calls this out by name ("Section Dividers (signature component)")
 * as replacing a plain `<hr>`/`border-top` everywhere on the homepage — "the
 * system's signature transition, not a one-off flourish." It previously lived
 * as identical inline markup pasted at the top of all 10 numbered sections in
 * index.astro; extracted here since every occurrence was byte-for-byte the
 * same (no per-section variation), so a future tweak applies once instead of
 * by hand in 10 places.
 */
---

<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:52px;"><div style="flex:1;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0%,oklch(1 0 0 / 0.12) 55%,oklch(0.75 0.13 80 / 0.55) 100%);"></div><div style="width:5px;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);background:oklch(0.75 0.13 80 / 0.75);"></div><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 100 100" style="animation:starSpin 45s linear infinite;" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="50,8 56.9,33.4 79.7,20.3 66.6,43.1 92,50 66.6,56.9 79.7,79.7 56.9,66.6 50,92 43.1,66.6 20.3,79.7 33.4,56.9 8,50 33.4,43.1 20.3,20.3 43.1,33.4" fill="none" stroke="var(--seal-gold)" stroke-width="5"></polygon></svg><div style="width:5px;height:5px;transform:rotate(45deg);background:oklch(0.75 0.13 80 / 0.75);"></div><div style="flex:1;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,oklch(0.75 0.13 80 / 0.55) 0%,oklch(1 0 0 / 0.12) 45%,transparent 100%);"></div></div>
